   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/c23968242d0c6359878e2e9f94c223bd.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/c23968242d0c6359878e2e9f94c223bd.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《WARDOGS》是一款全面戰爭 FPS，結合戰術射擊與聯合作戰，並融入建築與破壞機制，打造最多可容納 100 名玩家的大型軍事沙盒。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲模式：靈感來自「山丘之王」模式，三支隊伍在 256 平方公里的地圖中，爭奪隨機生成的 2×2 平方公里「控制區域」。控制區域內玩家數量最多的隊伍可獲得分數，率先達到 100 分的隊伍即贏得比賽。控制區域的位置與玩家的戰術選擇變化莫測，每場比賽都是獨一無二的戰場。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/688ea50a125f2a877236ab43c8090625.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/688ea50a125f2a877236ab43c8090625.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在《WARDOGS》中，每一個決定都至關重要。</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位玩家在開始《WARDOGS》旅程時都會擁有 $10,000。玩家每一次誕生後，都需要購買並打造裝備配置，從多樣化的武器、裝備與載具中做出選擇，協助隊伍贏得比賽。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的每一次團隊合作行動都會獲得金錢獎勵，無論是復活隊友、運送友軍前往區域，或是控制目標。我們不只鼓勵團隊合作，更會給予獎勵。玩家可以自行決定要如何遊玩、賺取並花費自己的收益。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金錢可跨局保留，因此在適當時機大手筆投資更好的武器、裝備或載具，就有機會力挽狂瀾，賺取可觀的回報。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/7173dc352f2f157160b11010b1a050cd.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/7173dc352f2f157160b11010b1a050cd.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>決定自己的玩法與獲利方式。</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊玩、獲利與成長的方式不只一種。《WARDOGS》賦予玩家高自由度，讓你以各種方式挑戰控制區域。無論是以孤狼身分支援隊伍，還是加入一支默契十足的小隊，如何踏入戰場完全由你決定。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以競逐「熱區」賺取雙倍金錢，購買吉利服從遠距離進行狙擊，或是駕駛直升機為隊友運送補給。此外，你也可以選擇建造自己的前線作戰基地來鞏固關鍵戰略要道；或者，如果你熱愛破壞……也可以駕駛砲兵戰車，朝敵人傾瀉毀滅性的火力。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《WARDOGS》中，交戰從不墨守成規。如何應對戰場，終究由你決定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/34c722c7fb195eef69b78cf9263b2382.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/34c722c7fb195eef69b78cf9263b2382.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >將混亂帶入戰術戰爭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用火箭發射器摧毀公寓大樓，或駕駛重裝甲坦克一路碾壓城鎮。你的每一次行動，都會改變你周遭的世界。相對地，你也可以與隊友擬定策略，在地圖中的關鍵位置進行建設與強化，取得戰術優勢。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/a90f37cdaa6dd91e93fbbf531ce45fef.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/a90f37cdaa6dd91e93fbbf531ce45fef.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《WARDOGS》中，每一刻皆由玩家 100% 主導。玩家可以透過近距離語音聊天交流，與隊友討論戰術，或是嘲諷敵方玩家。這不是另一款「大逃殺」，也不是另一款「撤離射擊遊戲」，《WARDOGS》是一款對全面戰爭 FPS 戰術遊戲的全新詮釋。鼓勵你發揮決策能力、溝通與團隊合作，並讓你在現代軍事背景下，找到屬於自己的玩法。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/c23968242d0c6359878e2e9f94c223bd.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/c23968242d0c6359878e2e9f94c223bd.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/8cafb56052c6ece0ae621691da1618a2.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《WARDOGS》是一款全面戰爭 FPS，結合戰術射擊與聯合作戰，並融入建築與破壞機制，打造最多可容納 100 名玩家的大型軍事沙盒。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲模式：靈感來自「山丘之王」模式，三支隊伍在 256 平方公里的地圖中，爭奪隨機生成的 2×2 平方公里「控制區域」。控制區域內玩家數量最多的隊伍可獲得分數，率先達到 100 分的隊伍即贏得比賽。控制區域的位置與玩家的戰術選擇變化莫測，每場比賽都是獨一無二的戰場。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/688ea50a125f2a877236ab43c8090625.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/688ea50a125f2a877236ab43c8090625.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/aac5f1f0782c612c0c0b1763cae54253.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在《WARDOGS》中，每一個決定都至關重要。</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位玩家在開始《WARDOGS》旅程時都會擁有 $10,000。玩家每一次誕生後，都需要購買並打造裝備配置，從多樣化的武器、裝備與載具中做出選擇，協助隊伍贏得比賽。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的每一次團隊合作行動都會獲得金錢獎勵，無論是復活隊友、運送友軍前往區域，或是控制目標。我們不只鼓勵團隊合作，更會給予獎勵。玩家可以自行決定要如何遊玩、賺取並花費自己的收益。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金錢可跨局保留，因此在適當時機大手筆投資更好的武器、裝備或載具，就有機會力挽狂瀾，賺取可觀的回報。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/7173dc352f2f157160b11010b1a050cd.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/7173dc352f2f157160b11010b1a050cd.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/e759726c4923cbd8e2edaba524ee7ee7.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>決定自己的玩法與獲利方式。</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊玩、獲利與成長的方式不只一種。《WARDOGS》賦予玩家高自由度，讓你以各種方式挑戰控制區域。無論是以孤狼身分支援隊伍，還是加入一支默契十足的小隊，如何踏入戰場完全由你決定。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以競逐「熱區」賺取雙倍金錢，購買吉利服從遠距離進行狙擊，或是駕駛直升機為隊友運送補給。此外，你也可以選擇建造自己的前線作戰基地來鞏固關鍵戰略要道；或者，如果你熱愛破壞……也可以駕駛砲兵戰車，朝敵人傾瀉毀滅性的火力。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《WARDOGS》中，交戰從不墨守成規。如何應對戰場，終究由你決定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/34c722c7fb195eef69b78cf9263b2382.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/34c722c7fb195eef69b78cf9263b2382.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/320bf18346e688eecd7c867786a53c0e.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >將混亂帶入戰術戰爭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用火箭發射器摧毀公寓大樓，或駕駛重裝甲坦克一路碾壓城鎮。你的每一次行動，都會改變你周遭的世界。相對地，你也可以與隊友擬定策略，在地圖中的關鍵位置進行建設與強化，取得戰術優勢。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/f5c5403a896b0a910d3708e758d63a7d.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/a90f37cdaa6dd91e93fbbf531ce45fef.avif?t=1791928607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras_big/a90f37cdaa6dd91e93fbbf531ce45fef.webp?t=1791928607 width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.poster.avif?t=1791928607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.webm?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867240/extras/84d320e9a5fe43524c39cd7d30d8ceb8.mp4?t=1791928607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《WARDOGS》中，每一刻皆由玩家 100% 主導。玩家可以透過近距離語音聊天交流，與隊友討論戰術，或是嘲諷敵方玩家。這不是另一款「大逃殺」，也不是另一款「撤離射擊遊戲」，《WARDOGS》是一款對全面戰爭 FPS 戰術遊戲的全新詮釋。鼓勵你發揮決策能力、溝通與團隊合作，並讓你在現代軍事背景下，找到屬於自己的玩法。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
   "short_description": "《WARDOGS》是一款戰術型全面戰爭 FPS 遊戲，共一百名玩家分成三支隊伍，爭奪控制區域。背景設定於東歐荒廢的工業山區，在可破壞的戰場上作戰並賺取金錢，因為現金為王。",
